    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHanging LED E27 lamp\u003c/strong\u003e that adds a touch of distinction to any space. Its \"\u003cstrong\u003emodern\u003c/strong\u003e\" design makes it perfect to pair with LED bulbs from our website. It brings personality and makes a difference in the decoration of your stylish spaces and venues with this range of hanging lamps.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuy your \u003cstrong\u003ewicker pendant lamp\u003c/strong\u003e for E27 bulb today and enjoy a natural and elegant lighting in your home. The lamp does \u003cstrong\u003eNOT include bulb,\u003c/strong\u003e to check our E27 bulbs click on the button:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/en/led-bulbs-lamps/base-types/e27\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eE27 LED BULB\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:left;\"\u003eWicker Pendant Light - KALMAR\u0026nbsp;-\u0026nbsp;E27\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet ready to light up your life in a completely new way with our spectacular \u003cstrong\u003ePendant Light\u003c/strong\u003e for \u003cstrong\u003eE27 LED Bulbs\u003c/strong\u003e! In a world that never stops evolving, keeping up with interior design trends and energy efficiency is essential. This light is not only a functional lighting piece, it is also a masterpiece of modern aesthetics that will completely transform your space while helping you save energy at the same time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ewicker pendant light\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for E27 bulbs is a natural, elegant choice for any interior space. Its simple, minimalist design suits any decorating style, from classic to modern.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe light is made from high-quality wicker with a natural finish that gives it a warm, welcoming look. The suspension cable is adjustable, so you can set the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eheight\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;of the light up to\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e120cm\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy choose our Pendant Light for E27 LED Bulbs? Here are some of its strengths and benefits that will convince you this is the perfect choice for your home:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nElegant, Minimalist Design: The pendant light features a minimalist design that pairs perfectly with any decorating style. Its clean lines and contemporary shape make it ideal for modern and classic spaces alike.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nHigh-Quality Materials: Made with high-quality materials, this light is built to last. Its sturdy structure ensures a long service life, which means you will not have to worry about replacing it any time soon.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nCompatible with E27 LED Bulbs: This pendant light works with E27 LED bulbs, letting you enjoy bright, energy-efficient lighting. LED bulbs are known for their long life and low energy consumption, which will help you cut your electricity bills.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nAdjustable and Customisable: The height of the pendant light is adjustable, so you can set it wherever you want it. You can also choose the LED bulb that best suits your preferences in colour temperature and wattage, giving you full control over the mood of your space.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nEasy Installation: You do not need to be a DIY expert to install this light. It comes with clear instructions and all the fittings you need, making assembly straightforward.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhere can you use this Pendant Light for E27 LED Bulbs?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe possibilities are endless. Picture this light hanging over your dining table, creating a warm, welcoming atmosphere for family dinners. It is also perfect for lighting your home work area, providing the right light to boost your productivity. Do you have a reading corner that needs a special touch? This pendant light could be the answer. Even in your bedroom, it will add a touch of elegance and practicality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn short, our Pendant Light for E27 LED Bulbs is far more than a simple light source. It is a statement of style and energy efficiency that will improve your home in ways you never imagined. Do not wait any longer to transform your space and start saving energy. Click the buy button and take the first step towards brighter, more sustainable lighting!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e* Bulb NOT INCLUDED\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide everything needed for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet for every LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
